{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Integrate OUDS","anchor":"Integrate-OUDS","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"Use Swift Package Manager","anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", you need to add our "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" into your project."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To do that, add a new "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"package dependency"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" to your "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" project by refering to it by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Import the librairies you need","anchor":"Import-the-librairies-you-need"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" products."}]},{"name":"Tip","style":"tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","level":3,"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and useless constants."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" product which suits your needs:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Umbrella","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above and all themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Wireframe theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Chose your theme","anchor":"Chose-your-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" framework provides today four themes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Compact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For Sosh products"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Apply a theme","anchor":"Apply-a-theme"},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" also."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme."}]}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text",